,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":428.422549528,"data":"   free alternative -- it is a different kernel path with a different\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":428.422552058,"data":"   numerics story and is NOT what the study's call shape uses.)\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":428.422554548,"data":"  returned o: shape=(1, 128, 2, 128) dtype=torch.bfloat16 finite=False  absmax=nan\n"}
