,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":428.422579445,"data":"  This is not a read of a variable; it is a read of the code ptxas was\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":428.422581944,"data":"  handed.  If fla had left TRITON_F32_DEFAULT alone, this would emit\n"}
,{"stream_name":"stdout","time":428.422584444,"data":"  mma.sync with tf32 operands.  If it wrote 'ieee', it emits fma.rn.f32.\n"}
